    "Source20recent MRU applies onlyindex eviction; independent lastSavedAt survives receiptcacheexpiry. No servernativepath/file-existence assertion.",
    "Exact reusable counts use nativeToReference then extracted sourceey. If valid projection is unavailable, fields omitted/knownfalse; never substitute allrules/allmapping count.",
